OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies arson over Dovestone
OL,4,Amoorland fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has pleaded not guilty to arson
OL,7,Fafter a large fire broke out on
OL,8,Fmoorland in Greater Manchester.
OL,10,FShania Care-Slede appeared via
OL,11,Fvideolink and denied two charges of
OL,12,Farson at Minshull Street Crown Court
OL,13,Fearlier but admitted a further charge
OL,14,Fof dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
