OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies arson over Dovestone
OL,4,Amoorland fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the large fire broke out
OL,7,Fnear Dovestone Reservoir, in
OL,8,FGreenfield, Saddleworth, on 11 July.
OL,9,FThe blaze took more than two weeks to
OL,10,Fcontain before it was finally put on 3
OL,11,FAugust. The reservoir was reopened to
OL,12,Fthe public for the first time on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FCare-Slede, 20, will face a trial for
OL,16,Fthe arson charges in May 2027.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
